# Phase 2: Network Traffic Collection

## Overview
This phase focuses on capturing network packets using Wireshark and preparing packet capture files for analysis.

## Objectives
- Capture live network traffic.
- Save packet captures for forensic analysis.
- Export captured data.

## Tasks Completed
- Started packet capture
- Applied capture filters
- Monitored network activity
- Saved packet captures as PCAP files
- Exported network traffic

## Technologies Used
- Wireshark
- PCAP Files

## Outcome
Successfully collected network traffic data for forensic investigation.
